"use strict";(self.webpackChunkquickbooks_connector_doc=self.webpackChunkquickbooks_connector_doc||[]).push([[103],{1003(e,t,a){a.r(t),a.d(t,{comp:()=>l,data:()=>i});var o=a(641);const n={},l=(0,a(6262).A)(n,[["render",function(e,t){return(0,o.uX)(),(0,o.CE)("div",null,[t[0]||(t[0]=(0,o.Fv)("<h1 id=\"quickbooks-dashboard\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#quickbooks-dashboard\"><span>QuickBooks Dashboard &amp; Intelligence</span></a></h1>\n<p class=\"cl-lead\" style=\"font-size:1.08rem;color:#475569;margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.6;\">The <strong>Dashboard</strong> (<code>tab=dashboard</code>) serves as your operational cockpit and financial intelligence center in WooCommerce QuickBooks Connector. Introduced in <strong>v4.0.0</strong>, it aggregates real-time sync KPIs, visualizes 7-day activity trends, isolates records requiring attention, and streams live financial metrics directly from Intuit QuickBooks Online without slowing down your WordPress admin.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/woocommerce-quickbooks-connector/images/quickbooks-connector/dashboard.webp\" alt=\"QuickBooks Dashboard &amp; Intelligence\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" style=\"border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);margin:1.25rem 0 2rem 0;\"></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"connection-overview\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#connection-overview\"><span>Connection Status &amp; Company Overview</span></a></h2>\n<p>At the top of the dashboard, the <strong>Connection Card</strong> provides instantaneous verification of your link to Intuit:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Environment Mode:</strong> Clearly badges whether the connector is operating in <code>Sandbox</code> (for testing) or <code>Production</code> (live commercial accounting).</li>\n  <li><strong>Connected Company:</strong> Displays the legal business entity name registered in QuickBooks Online (e.g. <em>Sandbox Company US f1a9</em>).</li>\n  <li><strong>Company Realm ID:</strong> Shows the unique Intuit Company Identifier (e.g. <code>9341457556369416</code>).</li>\n  <li><strong>OAuth Token Health:</strong> Shows active token validity and automated background renewal countdown.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2 id=\"sync-kpis\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sync-kpis\"><span>Executive Sync KPIs</span></a></h2>\n<p>Below the connection banner, 4 interactive KPI metric cards provide instant visibility over synchronized entity volumes:</p>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0 2rem 0;\">\n  <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Synced Orders</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin:6px 0;\">345 <span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#10b981;\">(98.2%)</span></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b;\">Invoices &amp; Sales Receipts exported</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Synced Products</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin:6px 0;\">128 <span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#10b981;\">(100%)</span></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b;\">Simple &amp; Variable inventory matched</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Synced Customers</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin:6px 0;\">89 <span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#10b981;\">(96.7%)</span></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b;\">Contacts reconciled with zero collisions</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Needs Attention</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:#ef4444;margin:6px 0;\">3 <span style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:#ef4444;\">Items</span></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b;\">Orders or items pending retry or mapping</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2 id=\"activity-chart\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#activity-chart\"><span>7-Day Sync Activity Chart &amp; Health Gauges</span></a></h2>\n<p>The dashboard provides visual tracking for weekly sync volume across all core entities:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Daily Trend Line:</strong> Displays successful vs failed transactions day-by-day over the rolling past week.</li>\n  <li><strong>Coverage Gauges:</strong> Visual circular dials displaying the percentage of catalog inventory mapped to active QuickBooks Income and Expense accounts.</li>\n  <li><strong>Action Scheduler Health:</strong> Real-time indicator displaying the Action Scheduler queue status, average latency, and background worker state.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2 id=\"attention-queue\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attention-queue\"><span>Needs Attention Queue &amp; 1-Click Resolution</span></a></h2>\n<p>When an order or item fails synchronization (due to temporary Intuit network timeouts, tax rate discrepancies, or missing account mappings), it is immediately isolated in the <strong>Needs Attention Table</strong> at the bottom of the dashboard:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Record ID &amp; Type:</strong> Identifies whether the failed entity is an Order, Customer, or Product.</li>\n  <li><strong>QuickBooks Error Diagnostic:</strong> Displays human-readable error messages (e.g. <em>Error 6240: Duplicate Document Number</em> or <em>AccountRef required</em>).</li>\n  <li><strong>Action Buttons:</strong>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Sync Now:</strong> Re-triggers synchronization immediately via AJAX.</li>\n      <li><strong>View Order:</strong> Opens the WooCommerce order edit page in a new tab.</li>\n      <li><strong>Ignore / Clear:</strong> Dismisses transient alerts once resolved in QuickBooks directly.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2 id=\"financial-snapshot\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#financial-snapshot\"><span>Live Financial Snapshot Widget</span></a></h2>\n<p>Store owners can monitor financial performance directly on the dashboard tab:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Today's Gross Sales:</strong> Total synchronized revenue recorded in QuickBooks today.</li>\n  <li><strong>Open Receivables (A/R):</strong> Current unpaid invoices awaiting customer payment.</li>\n  <li><strong>QuickBooks Bank Balance:</strong> Live balance of your primary mapped deposit account (retrieved via Intuit REST API).</li>\n  <li><strong>Deep Link to Reports:</strong> 1-click access to the <a class=\"route-link\" href=\"/woocommerce-quickbooks-connector/quickbooks-connector/reports.html\">Reports tab</a> for full Profit &amp; Loss, Balance Sheet, and Aging statements.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><strong>Next step:</strong> <a class=\"route-link\" href=\"/woocommerce-quickbooks-connector/quickbooks-connector/reports.html\">Explore Embedded Financial Reports &rarr;</a></p>",24))])}]]);var i={"path":"/quickbooks-connector/dashboard.html","title":"QuickBooks Dashboard & Intelligence","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"QuickBooks Dashboard & Intelligence","description":"Executive operational KPIs, 7-day sync activity trends, attention queue, and live financial metrics."},"headers":[]}}}]);